{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id582338298"}, "name":{"label":"tien1623"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-04T08:19:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"67.6"}, "id":{"label":"14262468005"}, "title":{"label":"Booking.com promised to refund me, but never did"}, "content":{"label":"I have been a Booking.com customer for many years. Unfortunately, this experience has seriously damaged my trust in the platform.\n\nAfter checking out on 28 April 2025, the hotel failed to return my €150 security deposit. I contacted the hotel many times but only received repeated statements that the deposit had been “cancelled” or “released,” without any proof.\n\nI then asked my bank to conduct a formal investigation. My bank confirmed in writing that:\n\n* The €150 payment to the hotel was successfully completed.\n* No refund has ever been received.\n* There is no authorization hold or pending release.\n* No refund is currently being processed.\n\nI submitted these official bank documents to Booking.com. Booking.com reviewed them and confirmed that my bank statement was valid.\n\nMost importantly, Booking.com sent me an email stating that they had instructed the hotel to refund the €150 within five business days, and that if the hotel failed to refund or respond within that timeframe, Booking.com would step in and refund the amount directly to me.\n\nUnfortunately, that deadline passed a long time ago.\n\nAs of today:\n\n* I have still not received my €150.\n* The hotel has not provided any documentary evidence that a refund was processed.\n* Booking.com has also not honored the commitment made in their own email to refund me if the hotel failed to do so.\n\nWhat disappoints me most is not only the money, but the lack of follow-through. I trusted Booking.com’s customer protection process, especially after receiving a written promise that they would intervene if necessary. Instead, I have spent months contacting the hotel, my bank, and Booking.com without any resolution.\n\nI hope Booking.com will review how cases like this are handled, because customer support should not make commitments that are ultimately not fulfilled.\n\nAt this point, I cannot recommend Booking.com based on this experience.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=367003839&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
